(243894, 15931, 6701, '<td valign="top">Heh, isn''t that the truth.  You ask everyone what time it is and they whip out their cells.  Good shot, could benefite from a bit more composition.</td>', 'Heh, isn''t that the truth.  You ask everyone what time it is and they whip out their cells.  Good shot, could benefite from a bit more composition.', '2003-03-24 00:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
