(243920, 15747, 4210, '<td valign="top">Ermm..... the person was becoming seriously inebriated while eating the apple? Sorry, that''s my first reaction. I think that this photo had alot of potential, but that all the apples should have been in focus.</td>', 'Ermm..... the person was becoming seriously inebriated while eating the apple? Sorry, that''s my first reaction. I think that this photo had alot of potential, but that all the apples should have been in focus.', '2003-03-24 00:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
