(243974, 15956, 3419, '<td valign="top">That wheel in the back looks out of place for this scene, but without it, there''d be a hole. Nice subject, composition and colors.</td>', 'That wheel in the back looks out of place for this scene, but without it, there''d be a hole. Nice subject, composition and colors.', '2003-03-24 00:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(243976, 15881, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, composition, and execution.</td>', 'Nice subject, composition, and execution.', '2003-03-24 00:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(243987, 15441, 1344, '<td valign="top">I dunno if I''m the first, but there''s sure to be many..  You spelled irrelevant wrong!<br/>Great concept, but for the misspelling and the bad reflections in the clock I can only give a 4.</td>', 'I dunno if I''m the first, but there''s sure to be many..  You spelled irrelevant wrong!Great concept, but for the misspelling and the bad reflections in the clock I can only give a 4.', '2003-03-24 00:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(243996, 15763, 92, '<td valign="top">Superb ! = 10</td>', 'Superb ! = 10', '2003-03-24 00:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(244003, 15725, 92, '<td valign="top">I love this clock and tower. The light distracts from it. I would like it much better without the light:)</td>', 'I love this clock and tower. The light distracts from it. I would like it much better without the light:)', '2003-03-24 00:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(244009, 15774, 1344, '<td valign="top">Why''d ya cut off the top of the meter?  Think this photo could have been helped with some more post processing in Pshop..  Not sure what, but something.   It''s just kind of bland.  Maybe jack up the contrast?  Play with saturation?  Dunno..</td>', 'Why''d ya cut off the top of the meter?  Think this photo could have been helped with some more post processing in Pshop..  Not sure what, but something.   It''s just kind of bland.  Maybe jack up the contrast?  Play with saturation?  Dunno..', '2003-03-24 00:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(244011, 15533, 1344, '<td valign="top">Are those trees growing thru that car?  heh</td>', 'Are those trees growing thru that car?  heh', '2003-03-24 00:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(244042, 15770, 6504, '<td valign="top">oops</td>', 'oops', '2003-03-24 01:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(244043, 15748, 6504, '<td valign="top">Nice time piece, I hope you caught it.  You captured it beautifully.</td>', 'Nice time piece, I hope you caught it.  You captured it beautifully.', '2003-03-24 01:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(244049, 15463, 6504, '<td valign="top">It took a minute to catch the numbers and what they represent.  Clever idea.<br/>A little more light would add a lot to this phot.</td>', 'It took a minute to catch the numbers and what they represent.  Clever idea.A little more light would add a lot to this phot.', '2003-03-24 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(244051, 15586, 6504, '<td valign="top">But where is the rest of the line?  It would be a good idea to have found a few more to line up in front of her.  A little more contrast would add to this photo.</td>', 'But where is the rest of the line?  It would be a good idea to have found a few more to line up in front of her.  A little more contrast would add to this photo.', '2003-03-24 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(244052, 15809, 1344, '<td valign="top">Where have I seen this technique before :)</td>', 'Where have I seen this technique before :)', '2003-03-24 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(244054, 15823, 2923, '<td valign="top">This would be a much better photo taken later in the afternoon, it''s simply too bright, washes out the details.</td>', 'This would be a much better photo taken later in the afternoon, it''s simply too bright, washes out the details.', '2003-03-24 01:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(244056, 15941, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image is stunning, the capture great - the angle of the duck''s head and the other duck tail is amazing timing. The crop is good, the light and ripples really add to the image as well. The title is hilarious and really makes the whole photograph.</td>', 'The image is stunning, the capture great - the angle of the duck''s head and the other duck tail is amazing timing. The crop is good, the light and ripples really add to the image as well. The title is hilarious and really makes the whole photograph.', '2003-03-24 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(244062, 15667, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice photo -- though a faster shutter speed should be better as the bulk of the water flow is completely washed out of details.<br/> <br/>Around 1/2 - 1/20 second would be best.  For example, see //www.pbase.com/image/3812395.<br/> <br/>I gave you an 8.</td>', 'Nice photo -- though a faster shutter speed should be better as the bulk of the water flow is completely washed out of details. Around 1/2 - 1/20 second would be best.  For example, see //www.pbase.com/image/3812395. I gave you an 8.', '2003-03-24 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(244065, 15763, 6284, '<td valign="top">nice panning =o)</td>', 'nice panning =o)', '2003-03-24 01:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(244079, 15760, 7500, '<td valign="top">the color of this picture, gives that old/antique feeling to it</td>', 'the color of this picture, gives that old/antique feeling to it', '2003-03-24 01:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(244083, 15768, 6892, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Where is this? It reminds me of an old mining town. You''ve done very well  creating an atmosphere of another era here.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Where is this? It reminds me of an old mining town. You''ve done very well  creating an atmosphere of another era here.', '2003-03-24 01:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(244085, 15798, 6892, '<td valign="top">Love the rustic look and feel.</td>', 'Love the rustic look and feel.', '2003-03-24 01:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(244086, 15763, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good colours.  It''s a shame that the whole car isn''t in the shot but I guess you did well to get any of it with the speed it was probably doing!</td>', 'Nice idea, good colours.  It''s a shame that the whole car isn''t in the shot but I guess you did well to get any of it with the speed it was probably doing!', '2003-03-24 01:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(244087, 15955, 6892, '<td valign="top">Nice. It''s hard to find timepieces with real "innards" anymore.</td>', 'Nice. It''s hard to find timepieces with real "innards" anymore.', '2003-03-24 01:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(244090, 15761, 6892, '<td valign="top">Nicely done span of the generations.</td>', 'Nicely done span of the generations.', '2003-03-24 01:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(244092, 15732, 6892, '<td valign="top">Wish we had architecture like this in my town.</td>', 'Wish we had architecture like this in my town.', '2003-03-24 01:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(244094, 15763, 6202, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2003-03-24 01:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(244098, 15747, 3273, '<td valign="top">I feel that this would have been better if all of the apples were in focus and on the same plane.  Excellent idea though (and original so far?)</td>', 'I feel that this would have been better if all of the apples were in focus and on the same plane.  Excellent idea though (and original so far?)', '2003-03-24 01:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(244100, 15872, 3273, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot.  At first I didn''t like the shadow, but then I realised that was the whole point of the photo!!  I like the off centre composition and the old tree trunk. 10/10</td>', 'Outstanding shot.  At first I didn''t like the shadow, but then I realised that was the whole point of the photo!!  I like the off centre composition and the old tree trunk. 10/10', '2003-03-24 02:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(244103, 15965, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice depth and colour</td>', 'Nice depth and colour', '2003-03-24 02:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(244120, 15827, 5865, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and very novel.  The trees are real ancients too and their shape really adds to the photograph.  The only problem that I have is that the background of railings, cars and houses is really distracting, but I suppose there is nothing that can be done about that.</td>', 'This is a great idea and very novel.  The trees are real ancients too and their shape really adds to the photograph.  The only problem that I have is that the background of railings, cars and houses is really distracting, but I suppose there is nothing that can be done about that.', '2003-03-24 03:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(244121, 15641, 5865, '<td valign="top">A reall beautiful photograph.  The strong sun could have been a problem, but I think the shadows add to the image.  Good shot.</td>', 'A reall beautiful photograph.  The strong sun could have been a problem, but I think the shadows add to the image.  Good shot.', '2003-03-24 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(244124, 15941, 7010, '<td valign="top">LMAO!!!</td>', 'LMAO!!!', '2003-03-24 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
