(244155, 15661, 7218, '<td valign="top">Nice view!</td>', 'Nice view!', '2003-03-24 07:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(244156, 15416, 7218, '<td valign="top">bautiful colors! nice pic</td>', 'bautiful colors! nice pic', '2003-03-24 07:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(244158, 15510, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good job of color and composition, however the left engine being cropped out is distracting.</td>', 'Good job of color and composition, however the left engine being cropped out is distracting.', '2003-03-24 07:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(244159, 15856, 3280, '<td valign="top">It feels a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'It feels a bit oversharpened.', '2003-03-24 07:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(244160, 15948, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, colors and focus are great. I might have cropped out the orange in the top right corner though.</td>', 'Nice shot, colors and focus are great. I might have cropped out the orange in the top right corner though.', '2003-03-24 07:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(244161, 15907, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little too dark.  Need to boost up the contrast in Post Processing.</td>', 'Nice shot but a little too dark.  Need to boost up the contrast in Post Processing.', '2003-03-24 07:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(244162, 15927, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great colors and good focus.  It feels as if it is going to tumble out of the right edge which is a little disconcerting.</td>', 'Great colors and good focus.  It feels as if it is going to tumble out of the right edge which is a little disconcerting.', '2003-03-24 07:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(244163, 15868, 3280, '<td valign="top">Probably the best Hourglass style shots this week. I like the clock in the background.  Good job.</td>', 'Probably the best Hourglass style shots this week. I like the clock in the background.  Good job.', '2003-03-24 07:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(244166, 15539, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I do not like the realization. I think that for that you should have try a dramatic picture , some high contrast, Black and white maybe but not just numbers on a clean wall. It does not , in my oppinion, give the sense of a jail wall.</td>', 'I like the idea but I do not like the realization. I think that for that you should have try a dramatic picture , some high contrast, Black and white maybe but not just numbers on a clean wall. It does not , in my oppinion, give the sense of a jail wall.', '2003-03-24 07:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(244168, 15695, 3320, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and realization. I like the silhouette approach. It bothers me a little (but not much) that theback of the neck touch the verticals lines on a tower. But very nice ....8. Lionel</td>', 'Very nice concept and realization. I like the silhouette approach. It bothers me a little (but not much) that theback of the neck touch the verticals lines on a tower. But very nice ....8. Lionel', '2003-03-24 07:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(244169, 15902, 3320, '<td valign="top">Very strong concept and very nice realization. I like a lot the high contrast and the grainy aspect of the shot. 8. Lionel</td>', 'Very strong concept and very nice realization. I like a lot the high contrast and the grainy aspect of the shot. 8. Lionel', '2003-03-24 07:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(244171, 15948, 3320, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and colors. I think you should have cropped the upper right orange/brown part or manage that it''s in the same tone, I thik it''s distracting and lead the eye there; Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice picture and colors. I think you should have cropped the upper right orange/brown part or manage that it''s in the same tone, I thik it''s distracting and lead the eye there; Nice colors.', '2003-03-24 07:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(244172, 15940, 3320, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and nice realization. The grain is appropriate and the light projections give the shot nice contrasts and other ways for the eye to go throught the picture. 7. Lionel</td>', 'Very good idea and nice realization. The grain is appropriate and the light projections give the shot nice contrasts and other ways for the eye to go throught the picture. 7. Lionel', '2003-03-24 07:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(244173, 15758, 2978, '<td valign="top">Motion capture is good. Not really sure about time</td>', 'Motion capture is good. Not really sure about time', '2003-03-24 07:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(244174, 15869, 2978, '<td valign="top">For me it''s a bit bright andbleached.</td>', 'For me it''s a bit bright andbleached.', '2003-03-24 07:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(244175, 15417, 2978, '<td valign="top">the clock is dirty</td>', 'the clock is dirty', '2003-03-24 07:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(244176, 15667, 5865, '<td valign="top">I''m always a sucker for these water shots.  Good movement photography.  I like the way the texture of the rocks are brought out by the water on them.  Exposure seems good to me and nicely composed.  I enjoy it very much.</td>', 'I''m always a sucker for these water shots.  Good movement photography.  I like the way the texture of the rocks are brought out by the water on them.  Exposure seems good to me and nicely composed.  I enjoy it very much.', '2003-03-24 07:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(244180, 15573, 2978, '<td valign="top">I can''t relate thse beads to Time, apart from the title.</td>', 'I can''t relate thse beads to Time, apart from the title.', '2003-03-24 07:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(244182, 15187, 5865, '<td valign="top">Powerful image putting across a strong message.</td>', 'Powerful image putting across a strong message.', '2003-03-24 07:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(244183, 15677, 2978, '<td valign="top">Eventhough, I think this wall is too new for it. Maybe I''ve seen too many ruin</td>', 'Eventhough, I think this wall is too new for it. Maybe I''ve seen too many ruin', '2003-03-24 07:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(244184, 15685, 5865, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic.  The colours of the reflection really work well with the gold colour of the watch.</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic.  The colours of the reflection really work well with the gold colour of the watch.', '2003-03-24 07:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(244185, 15332, 2978, '<td valign="top">Need lighting work</td>', 'Need lighting work', '2003-03-24 07:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(244186, 15779, 5865, '<td valign="top">I didn''t give you permission to photograph my house :)  The photograph certainly shows the effect of time.  What I found to be fascinating was that the image is naturally sepia.  A great shot.</td>', 'I didn''t give you permission to photograph my house :)  The photograph certainly shows the effect of time.  What I found to be fascinating was that the image is naturally sepia.  A great shot.', '2003-03-24 07:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(244187, 15617, 2978, '<td valign="top">The composition of these clock is not quite in. Not to mention DOF</td>', 'The composition of these clock is not quite in. Not to mention DOF', '2003-03-24 07:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(244188, 15775, 2978, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t get the picture</td>', 'Sorry I don''t get the picture', '2003-03-24 08:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(244189, 15851, 5865, '<td valign="top">I liked this scene.  I think someone else has used it (which is ok of course) but with both shots I personally think that there is too much rock showing.  I think that the composition would be improved if about 1/3 of the bottom of the photo were cropped.  I also think that it would have looked better if the house were in focus and the rocks out of focus rather than the other way round.  I like the way a ''v'' shape is cut into the rock to lead the eye into the shot, but with the house out of focus it loses it''s appeal for me.  Nice scene though.</td>', 'I liked this scene.  I think someone else has used it (which is ok of course) but with both shots I personally think that there is too much rock showing.  I think that the composition would be improved if about 1/3 of the bottom of the photo were cropped.  I also think that it would have looked better if the house were in focus and the rocks out of focus rather than the other way round.  I like the way a ''v'' shape is cut into the rock to lead the eye into the shot, but with the house out of focus it loses it''s appeal for me.  Nice scene though.', '2003-03-24 08:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(244190, 15841, 2978, '<td valign="top">Some lighting work or, at least, selected background would make it better</td>', 'Some lighting work or, at least, selected background would make it better', '2003-03-24 08:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(244191, 15360, 2978, '<td valign="top">If you want to shoot the house, the trees should be fixed out.</td>', 'If you want to shoot the house, the trees should be fixed out.', '2003-03-24 08:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(244192, 15005, 5865, '<td valign="top">Everything looks a little clumsy here.  It is a great idea as there are all sorts of colours being reflected off the watches, but it just seems too untidy.  I think that the shot may have been improved upon if the whole of the table were covered, but I guess  you would need a few more watches for that.</td>', 'Everything looks a little clumsy here.  It is a great idea as there are all sorts of colours being reflected off the watches, but it just seems too untidy.  I think that the shot may have been improved upon if the whole of the table were covered, but I guess  you would need a few more watches for that.', '2003-03-24 08:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(244193, 15936, 2978, '<td valign="top">Quite nice. But I would find the better position to get this shot</td>', 'Quite nice. But I would find the better position to get this shot', '2003-03-24 08:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(244194, 15663, 5865, '<td valign="top">I think that this scene is great, but the composition could have been improved upon if you had used the rule of thirds, i.e. crop some of the bottom of the picture off to place the horizon a third of the way up the scene.  It is a great scene though and surely shows the effects of time.</td>', 'I think that this scene is great, but the composition could have been improved upon if you had used the rule of thirds, i.e. crop some of the bottom of the picture off to place the horizon a third of the way up the scene.  It is a great scene though and surely shows the effects of time.', '2003-03-24 08:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
