(244453, 15663, 4767, '<td valign="top">Do the circular objects in the foreground indicate that time is a lot of. . .<br/>cow flop?  <br/>Time, lost dreams, isolation... I kinda like it all.</td>', 'Do the circular objects in the foreground indicate that time is a lot of. . .cow flop?  Time, lost dreams, isolation... I kinda like it all.', '2003-03-24 10:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
