(244462, 15612, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the blur of the roman numerals and the numbers, adding an ''old'' and ''new'' to the motion of time as well. The crop is good, and I think the blue tone works well.</td>', 'I like the blur of the roman numerals and the numbers, adding an ''old'' and ''new'' to the motion of time as well. The crop is good, and I think the blue tone works well.', '2003-03-24 11:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(244463, 15799, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interestingly done!  I see the alarm is on mute.</td>', 'Interestingly done!  I see the alarm is on mute.', '2003-03-24 11:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(244464, 15915, 641, '<td valign="top">Nothing to say, except.. great job. I love the effect of this.</td>', 'Nothing to say, except.. great job. I love the effect of this.', '2003-03-24 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(244465, 15970, 7364, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good one for the Song Titles challenge :-)</td>', 'This would have been a good one for the Song Titles challenge :-)', '2003-03-24 11:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(244466, 15174, 7364, '<td valign="top">Political sentiments aside, I have to judge this photo on it''s own merits.</td>', 'Political sentiments aside, I have to judge this photo on it''s own merits.', '2003-03-24 11:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(244467, 15902, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the interpretation of time that this represents. The light/shadow works very well. I''m not sure if it''s the texture of the skull or if  the picture is grainy, but I think either way it really adds to the age and impact of the image.</td>', 'I like the interpretation of time that this represents. The light/shadow works very well. I''m not sure if it''s the texture of the skull or if  the picture is grainy, but I think either way it really adds to the age and impact of the image.', '2003-03-24 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(244468, 15859, 7364, '<td valign="top">alternate title, "Time to get sober" :-)</td>', 'alternate title, "Time to get sober" :-)', '2003-03-24 11:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(244470, 15974, 7364, '<td valign="top">I HOPE that''s an index finger!</td>', 'I HOPE that''s an index finger!', '2003-03-24 11:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(244471, 15510, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like the way you arranged for those ominous clouds to be in the background.</td>', 'I like the way you arranged for those ominous clouds to be in the background.', '2003-03-24 11:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(244472, 15930, 7364, '<td valign="top">... so are the days of our lives.  ANyway.  good photo.  Would have scored monotone print higher.</td>', '... so are the days of our lives.  ANyway.  good photo.  Would have scored monotone print higher.', '2003-03-24 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(244474, 15734, 4767, '<td valign="top">A soft, warm feeling.  The grain adds to the whole feeling of this pic.</td>', 'A soft, warm feeling.  The grain adds to the whole feeling of this pic.', '2003-03-24 11:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(244475, 15827, 7364, '<td valign="top">from your title, I assume that''s a child on the sidewalk.  At first I thought it was an old lady and I couldn''t figure out if the sapling was the tree of the person :-)</td>', 'from your title, I assume that''s a child on the sidewalk.  At first I thought it was an old lady and I couldn''t figure out if the sapling was the tree of the person :-)', '2003-03-24 11:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(244476, 15962, 7364, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2003-03-24 11:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(244477, 15187, 6008, '<td valign="top">The double meaning of the title is clever and adds a very sombre mood to the image. The capture of the helicopters in the background is impressive, and the silhouette of the foreground, which gives just enough detail to see the ''maturity'' of the subjects, really punctuates the impact. An original interpretation of the challenge, I like it.</td>', 'The double meaning of the title is clever and adds a very sombre mood to the image. The capture of the helicopters in the background is impressive, and the silhouette of the foreground, which gives just enough detail to see the ''maturity'' of the subjects, really punctuates the impact. An original interpretation of the challenge, I like it.', '2003-03-24 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(244478, 15308, 4767, '<td valign="top">Time to keep on shovelling, apparently...  what happened in the lower right corner?</td>', 'Time to keep on shovelling, apparently...  what happened in the lower right corner?', '2003-03-24 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(244479, 15666, 7364, '<td valign="top">There''s something wrong with the areas on the fringe of the photo.  The color is weird.  What is that?</td>', 'There''s something wrong with the areas on the fringe of the photo.  The color is weird.  What is that?', '2003-03-24 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(244481, 15839, 7364, '<td valign="top">nice concept.  It reminds me of those "priceless" commercials.</td>', 'nice concept.  It reminds me of those "priceless" commercials.', '2003-03-24 11:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(244482, 15761, 4767, '<td valign="top">Move over Norman Rockwell!  I LIKE this image!</td>', 'Move over Norman Rockwell!  I LIKE this image!', '2003-03-24 11:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(244485, 15334, 7364, '<td valign="top">or at least a jar eh?</td>', 'or at least a jar eh?', '2003-03-24 11:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(244487, 15695, 6008, '<td valign="top">The perspective and lighting in this image is quite stunning, and the silhouette really adds something to the image. It is just a shame that I am unable to see the whole image on my screen.</td>', 'The perspective and lighting in this image is quite stunning, and the silhouette really adds something to the image. It is just a shame that I am unable to see the whole image on my screen.', '2003-03-24 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(244488, 15333, 7364, '<td valign="top">woah, creepy!</td>', 'woah, creepy!', '2003-03-24 11:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(244489, 15868, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice sepia toning, great composition - 10.</td>', 'Nice sepia toning, great composition - 10.', '2003-03-24 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(244490, 15872, 4767, '<td valign="top">TWO timekeepers, I''d say!  Very nice composition!</td>', 'TWO timekeepers, I''d say!  Very nice composition!', '2003-03-24 11:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
