(244507, 15801, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful coloring, really sets in a cool mood. The crop is awesome and the long shutter speed (8 seconds?) gives this image that final kick effect - 10.</td>', 'Wonderful coloring, really sets in a cool mood. The crop is awesome and the long shutter speed (8 seconds?) gives this image that final kick effect - 10.', '2003-03-24 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
