(244591, 15931, 6663, '<td valign="top">Really, really like it - looks like a still from a sci-fi movie! Also a refreshingly different approach in a week stuffed with shots of watches, hourglasses and clock towers. An interesting social comment, too - I know I sometimes no longer wear a watch because I''ve got my phone! A good photo which works on many levels; one of my favourites this week. 9.</td>', 'Really, really like it - looks like a still from a sci-fi movie! Also a refreshingly different approach in a week stuffed with shots of watches, hourglasses and clock towers. An interesting social comment, too - I know I sometimes no longer wear a watch because I''ve got my phone! A good photo which works on many levels; one of my favourites this week. 9.', '2003-03-24 12:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(244592, 15491, 6663, '<td valign="top">The fact that you''ve had to specify what date this was built detracts from the photo - just accentuates the fact that the ''time'' theme isn''t present in this pic. A real pity, because this is a very good shot of a lovely little building. Sorry 6.</td>', 'The fact that you''ve had to specify what date this was built detracts from the photo - just accentuates the fact that the ''time'' theme isn''t present in this pic. A real pity, because this is a very good shot of a lovely little building. Sorry 6.', '2003-03-24 12:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
