(244719, 15768, 7364, '<td valign="top">wow, now That''s a good picture!  The connection with the concept of time is weak, but the elements are definately old.  I would call it nostalgic, which is definatly time related.  Very good job!<br/> <br/>The more I think about it, the more I love the idea of choosing to look at times past as nostalgic.  We can regreat the past, we can hate the past, we can be bitter with the past, but what a woderful way to communicate the passage of time than to invoke nostalgia - very original in this contest!  Excellent job!</td>', 'wow, now That''s a good picture!  The connection with the concept of time is weak, but the elements are definately old.  I would call it nostalgic, which is definatly time related.  Very good job! The more I think about it, the more I love the idea of choosing to look at times past as nostalgic.  We can regreat the past, we can hate the past, we can be bitter with the past, but what a woderful way to communicate the passage of time than to invoke nostalgia - very original in this contest!  Excellent job!', '2003-03-24 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
