(245160, 15725, 6532, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Where is this?  Could you have gotten the shot without the street lamp in the way.<br/></td>', 'Cool.  Where is this?  Could you have gotten the shot without the street lamp in the way.', '2003-03-24 20:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(245161, 14996, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice colors</td>', 'Nice colors', '2003-03-24 20:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(245162, 15866, 6600, '<td valign="top">When I starting looking over all the TIME entries, I was hoping to find some good examples that would pull off the challenge without using a ''clock''.....  What I am finding is that the better photos (in most cases) include clocks of some kind.  I can''t fault those who took great shots with ''clock'' subject matter now can I?<br/> <br/> I find your choice of orientation and composition to be very pleasing and a nice departure.  Nice job!<br/></td>', 'When I starting looking over all the TIME entries, I was hoping to find some good examples that would pull off the challenge without using a ''clock''.....  What I am finding is that the better photos (in most cases) include clocks of some kind.  I can''t fault those who took great shots with ''clock'' subject matter now can I?  I find your choice of orientation and composition to be very pleasing and a nice departure.  Nice job!', '2003-03-24 20:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(245163, 15827, 6532, '<td valign="top">I like the title.  Pic is nice.  seems to be focused on foreground.</td>', 'I like the title.  Pic is nice.  seems to be focused on foreground.', '2003-03-24 20:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(245166, 15955, 6893, '<td valign="top">Its great to see that there are still old fashioned time pieces around.  Nice job on capturing the detail.</td>', 'Its great to see that there are still old fashioned time pieces around.  Nice job on capturing the detail.', '2003-03-24 20:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(245168, 15822, 6532, '<td valign="top">Bottom is cropped to tight.</td>', 'Bottom is cropped to tight.', '2003-03-24 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(245169, 15533, 6532, '<td valign="top">WOW  - guess that car wont be going anywhere....</td>', 'WOW  - guess that car wont be going anywhere....', '2003-03-24 20:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(245172, 15956, 6600, '<td valign="top">This appears to have taken some preparation to accomplish (good effort).  I find myself drawn to the floor though, (mainly because the debris and the white string) and would have prefered being directed more toward the great portraits.  Neat pic!</td>', 'This appears to have taken some preparation to accomplish (good effort).  I find myself drawn to the floor though, (mainly because the debris and the white string) and would have prefered being directed more toward the great portraits.  Neat pic!', '2003-03-24 20:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(245173, 15891, 6532, '<td valign="top">GREAT colors and capture of movement.  10.</td>', 'GREAT colors and capture of movement.  10.', '2003-03-24 20:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(245180, 15827, 6600, '<td valign="top">Is that an old lady?  I know shes younger than those ''great'' trees but I would have found a cooperative  toddler to take her place.  Love those trees!</td>', 'Is that an old lady?  I know shes younger than those ''great'' trees but I would have found a cooperative  toddler to take her place.  Love those trees!', '2003-03-24 20:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(245186, 15766, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  I like the absence of color next to the flower.  I might have removed the the balance of yellow from the front of the scene (distracts from the flower).  Good Job!</td>', 'Nicely done!  I like the absence of color next to the flower.  I might have removed the the balance of yellow from the front of the scene (distracts from the flower).  Good Job!', '2003-03-24 20:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(245188, 15231, 6600, '<td valign="top">Good things come to those who wait, no?  Like the perspective and composition for the most part.  Possibly could have been a bit brighter (on my screen).  Neat pic!</td>', 'Good things come to those who wait, no?  Like the perspective and composition for the most part.  Possibly could have been a bit brighter (on my screen).  Neat pic!', '2003-03-24 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
