(245231, 15913, 5266, '<td valign="top">Photo is a bit crooked - that''s unsettling.  Like the photo otherwise - neat clocks and I like the B&amp;W</td>', 'Photo is a bit crooked - that''s unsettling.  Like the photo otherwise - neat clocks and I like the B&W', '2003-03-24 21:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(245232, 15843, 6600, '<td valign="top">Lacks any real composition (in my opinion), and the background makes this shot a tad busy.</td>', 'Lacks any real composition (in my opinion), and the background makes this shot a tad busy.', '2003-03-24 21:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(245235, 15927, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  These clocks a becoming a bit repetitive though....</td>', 'Nice perspective.  These clocks a becoming a bit repetitive though....', '2003-03-24 21:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(245238, 15163, 5266, '<td valign="top">I really like the building, but the misty effect you have applied is over the top.  I can''t tell if it''s in focus.  I think this would have been better 1) without the effect applied (perhaps in sepia tones would be OK and 2) if you could have managed to get the photo with only "old" cars in it - there are loads of them in Havana.  This could have been an "antiquey" looking photo, but it just seems to be a hazy looking photo.</td>', 'I really like the building, but the misty effect you have applied is over the top.  I can''t tell if it''s in focus.  I think this would have been better 1) without the effect applied (perhaps in sepia tones would be OK and 2) if you could have managed to get the photo with only "old" cars in it - there are loads of them in Havana.  This could have been an "antiquey" looking photo, but it just seems to be a hazy looking photo.', '2003-03-24 21:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(245244, 14978, 6600, '<td valign="top">Hey a clock!..... go figure!  Just kidding!  These clocks are becoming a bit repetitive and more difficult to critique though.  Not bad composition, pic seems to have excessive noise/graininess.</td>', 'Hey a clock!..... go figure!  Just kidding!  These clocks are becoming a bit repetitive and more difficult to critique though.  Not bad composition, pic seems to have excessive noise/graininess.', '2003-03-24 21:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
