(245605, 15760, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the colouring on this shot, and the angle is nice. I think it all looks a little blurry probably due to resizing down. You could try using the Unsharp Mask tool to fox that up. I also notice some lines down the image which seem to cut off the numbers, which is a bit distracting. I think this is to do with however you resized your photo.</td>', 'I like the colouring on this shot, and the angle is nice. I think it all looks a little blurry probably due to resizing down. You could try using the Unsharp Mask tool to fox that up. I also notice some lines down the image which seem to cut off the numbers, which is a bit distracting. I think this is to do with however you resized your photo.', '2003-03-25 03:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
