(245775, 15730, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent landscape idea that shows how time leaves some things behind... I think this composition could be a little stronger if you remove some of the foreground and bring the old barn lower in the frame...  the tonal range is also a little flat... maybe some level and contrast adjustments would bring that up a bit also... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent landscape idea that shows how time leaves some things behind... I think this composition could be a little stronger if you remove some of the foreground and bring the old barn lower in the frame...  the tonal range is also a little flat... maybe some level and contrast adjustments would bring that up a bit also... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-25 10:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(245776, 15831, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition... Time is evident for sure... the lighting is also excellent... - setzler</td>', 'Very nice composition... Time is evident for sure... the lighting is also excellent... - setzler', '2003-03-25 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
