(245838, 15926, 7357, '<td valign="top">i agree that we need world peace but there are to many problems for world peace to just be real tomorrow</td>', 'i agree that we need world peace but there are to many problems for world peace to just be real tomorrow', '2003-03-25 11:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(245848, 15916, 1344, '<td valign="top">Looks more like quarter to two to me :)  Nice photo -- good cropping.  Although, I think I may have taken a sliver more off the bottom so ya dont get that bit of space between the bottom of the clock and the edge of the photo.  Maybe brighten it up a bit so you can see more detail in the arch? (my work monitor aint the best, so I may be off on this one)..     7</td>', 'Looks more like quarter to two to me :)  Nice photo -- good cropping.  Although, I think I may have taken a sliver more off the bottom so ya dont get that bit of space between the bottom of the clock and the edge of the photo.  Maybe brighten it up a bit so you can see more detail in the arch? (my work monitor aint the best, so I may be off on this one)..     7', '2003-03-25 12:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(245852, 15839, 1344, '<td valign="top">terrific photograph, but I dont see "time" anywhere but in the title.   This one''s a stretch..   Dont take it the wrong way, but without the title, this photo does not convey "time" to me</td>', 'terrific photograph, but I dont see "time" anywhere but in the title.   This one''s a stretch..   Dont take it the wrong way, but without the title, this photo does not convey "time" to me', '2003-03-25 12:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(245855, 15549, 3320, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I likea lot the shots when there is a symetry (the horizon line) like this that is not related on a centered horizontal line. VEry nice composition .. it''s like we are there. Symbol of another time , an other technology. Great picture. 8. Lionel</td>', 'Very nice shot. I likea lot the shots when there is a symetry (the horizon line) like this that is not related on a centered horizontal line. VEry nice composition .. it''s like we are there. Symbol of another time , an other technology. Great picture. 8. Lionel', '2003-03-25 12:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(245861, 15533, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo and good color, too!  I really like the tree growing through the engine compartment.   Challenge - I get the idea you are going for, but it wasn''t the sort of thing I had in mind.  Still, it''s a better photo than a 5, so score upgrade to 6.  Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo and good color, too!  I really like the tree growing through the engine compartment.   Challenge - I get the idea you are going for, but it wasn''t the sort of thing I had in mind.  Still, it''s a better photo than a 5, so score upgrade to 6.  Swash', '2003-03-25 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(245862, 15584, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty clear, but on the harsh side.  It seems to me that the contrast isn''t strong enough.  Without the title, this photo could represent many thoughts - "he''s mad at you and not talking to you sort of thing", to "what is he looking at?" 5 Swash</td>', 'It''s pretty clear, but on the harsh side.  It seems to me that the contrast isn''t strong enough.  Without the title, this photo could represent many thoughts - "he''s mad at you and not talking to you sort of thing", to "what is he looking at?" 5 Swash', '2003-03-25 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(245864, 15839, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo.  I''m sure you had lots of fun!  Without the title, this could represent many ideas - such as ads for the tire, car or outdoor sporting, but I don''t get any sense of "time" w/o the title.  5 Swash</td>', 'Very clear photo.  I''m sure you had lots of fun!  Without the title, this could represent many ideas - such as ads for the tire, car or outdoor sporting, but I don''t get any sense of "time" w/o the title.  5 Swash', '2003-03-25 12:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(245865, 15734, 1005, '<td valign="top">???  A sillhouetted tree in the window blind at sunset???  Nice colors, even through the blind, but I don''t feel a sense of time from this photo.  The cropping seems a little odd (differently sized dark areas around the window).  Picture seems well under the photo size limits, too.  5 Swash</td>', '???  A sillhouetted tree in the window blind at sunset???  Nice colors, even through the blind, but I don''t feel a sense of time from this photo.  The cropping seems a little odd (differently sized dark areas around the window).  Picture seems well under the photo size limits, too.  5 Swash', '2003-03-25 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(245866, 15644, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat sculpture.  Focus seems pretty good.  Color is good, too.  Lighting - a little glaring on the table (upper right corner).  Challenge - other than the title, I just don''t see it (sorry).  Please see Site Rules - Subject Matter - Artwork.  (IMO needs more of your input)  5 Swash</td>', 'Neat sculpture.  Focus seems pretty good.  Color is good, too.  Lighting - a little glaring on the table (upper right corner).  Challenge - other than the title, I just don''t see it (sorry).  Please see Site Rules - Subject Matter - Artwork.  (IMO needs more of your input)  5 Swash', '2003-03-25 12:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(245870, 15761, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wondering who took this - similar lighting to another familiar shot from this site...can''t recall the name!  Anyways, great pic - I was thinking of my mom, my sister and my niece as a generations shot, but I wanted 1 or 2 more ''generations.''  Great execution - I love the empty space.</td>', 'Wondering who took this - similar lighting to another familiar shot from this site...can''t recall the name!  Anyways, great pic - I was thinking of my mom, my sister and my niece as a generations shot, but I wanted 1 or 2 more ''generations.''  Great execution - I love the empty space.', '2003-03-25 13:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(245871, 15799, 5658, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see the set up for this picture.<br/>The colors really cought my attention</td>', 'I''d love to see the set up for this picture.The colors really cought my attention', '2003-03-25 13:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(245875, 15891, 5658, '<td valign="top">Of all the time elapse &amp; macro photos, this was my favorite.<br/>The elegant, yet simple clock face compliments the<br/>equally simple second-hand.</td>', 'Of all the time elapse & macro photos, this was my favorite.The elegant, yet simple clock face compliments theequally simple second-hand.', '2003-03-25 13:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(245878, 15770, 6900, '<td valign="top">Did something go wrong here?  I''m afraid the title makes no sense to me.  And the picture really isn''t.  There''s minimalist, but this is over that line.</td>', 'Did something go wrong here?  I''m afraid the title makes no sense to me.  And the picture really isn''t.  There''s minimalist, but this is over that line.', '2003-03-25 13:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(245880, 15665, 6900, '<td valign="top">That light blue REALLY messed up a great shot.</td>', 'That light blue REALLY messed up a great shot.', '2003-03-25 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(245881, 15348, 5658, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is a high quality stop watch, but it dosent look very intersting.<br/>The angle of the shot is dead on straight.  The time-elapse effect<br/>of the second-hand is to blurry to be interesting.<br/> <br/>Try a different angle and maybe a strobe light next time.</td>', 'I''m sure this is a high quality stop watch, but it dosent look very intersting.The angle of the shot is dead on straight.  The time-elapse effectof the second-hand is to blurry to be interesting. Try a different angle and maybe a strobe light next time.', '2003-03-25 13:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
