(245948, 15940, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very good spin on the subject.  Lighting and noise (grain) really adds to the mood.  Grain seems a bit overpowering, though...</td>', 'Very good spin on the subject.  Lighting and noise (grain) really adds to the mood.  Grain seems a bit overpowering, though...', '2003-03-25 13:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
