(246462, 15727, 6172, '<td valign="top">This could have been even more effective if the clock were more inappropriate to the surroundings, you know what I mean?  Like a clock that seemed even more out of place than this one does, because this one seems to be in the style of the surroundings.  Just rambling.  Nice photo, I like your willingness to violate the conventional.</td>', 'This could have been even more effective if the clock were more inappropriate to the surroundings, you know what I mean?  Like a clock that seemed even more out of place than this one does, because this one seems to be in the style of the surroundings.  Just rambling.  Nice photo, I like your willingness to violate the conventional.', '2003-03-26 01:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(246463, 15868, 6172, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of DOF.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like your choice of DOF.  Nice shot.', '2003-03-26 01:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
