(246467, 15728, 6172, '<td valign="top">A WHAT?  Sorry, I don''t know much about "Greenwich Time Balls", I guess I should go look it up in the encyclopedia!   Very nice photo though, I hope you do well with it!</td>', 'A WHAT?  Sorry, I don''t know much about "Greenwich Time Balls", I guess I should go look it up in the encyclopedia!   Very nice photo though, I hope you do well with it!', '2003-03-26 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
