(246478, 15695, 6388, '<td valign="top">I REALLY liked it until I scrolled down and saw the person...the I just liked it -no offense intended to the person.  did you take any of just the tower?</td>', 'I REALLY liked it until I scrolled down and saw the person...the I just liked it -no offense intended to the person.  did you take any of just the tower?', '2003-03-26 03:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(246479, 15666, 6388, '<td valign="top">seems oversaturated or something.  the harsh lights reflected on the eye are a bit distracting - using a diffuser or a reflector should take it out (if you didn''t intend it to be there.  good idea.</td>', 'seems oversaturated or something.  the harsh lights reflected on the eye are a bit distracting - using a diffuser or a reflector should take it out (if you didn''t intend it to be there.  good idea.', '2003-03-26 03:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
