(246673, 15906, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and blackness of this shot. The camera reflection doesn''t do much more me, but I love the idea. Very well executed. good marks from me.</td>', 'I like the tones and blackness of this shot. The camera reflection doesn''t do much more me, but I love the idea. Very well executed. good marks from me.', '2003-03-26 11:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(246674, 15891, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, the first clock shot that I like. And I seem to be getting all the good ones together. This is wonderful - is this a long exposure or multiple - the latter I''d guess, as there''s so very little motion blur between the iterations of the second hand. Great work. Really great work. &lt;edit&gt; I''ve been out all day today shooting, and this shot has really stayed in my mind - one of the best shots I''ve seen on the entire site. One thing: coming back to it, those dust spots really bother me (if that''s what they are)</td>', 'Ah, the first clock shot that I like. And I seem to be getting all the good ones together. This is wonderful - is this a long exposure or multiple - the latter I''d guess, as there''s so very little motion blur between the iterations of the second hand. Great work. Really great work. <edit> I''ve been out all day today shooting, and this shot has really stayed in my mind - one of the best shots I''ve seen on the entire site. One thing: coming back to it, those dust spots really bother me (if that''s what they are)', '2003-03-26 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(246676, 15667, 6870, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this wouldn''t have much to do with time, but I think it is a well executed image with lovely tones and a great sense of the water''s movement. Nice work.</td>', 'Without the title, this wouldn''t have much to do with time, but I think it is a well executed image with lovely tones and a great sense of the water''s movement. Nice work.', '2003-03-26 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
