(246972, 15103, 7291, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell if this was done with a long exposure and someone "air drawing" this with lights.  If that''s the case....then WOW!</td>', 'It''s hard to tell if this was done with a long exposure and someone "air drawing" this with lights.  If that''s the case....then WOW!', '2003-03-26 16:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(246985, 15924, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good picture!  Color is great!  Focus is intensely nice.  Challenge-wise - the wrist watch seems to me to be either forced or incidental, challenge met, but not at the high end of that scale.  Originally scored this a 7, but the quality is high enough to go an 8, even if the "time" is forced.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very good picture!  Color is great!  Focus is intensely nice.  Challenge-wise - the wrist watch seems to me to be either forced or incidental, challenge met, but not at the high end of that scale.  Originally scored this a 7, but the quality is high enough to go an 8, even if the "time" is forced.  Rob the Swash', '2003-03-26 16:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(246987, 15224, 1005, '<td valign="top">High angle shots can increase the interest in a photo, but the LCD screen seems ghosted (were you going for that effect? Title doesn''t suggest it)  Background is nicely blurred out, but still enough going on to confuse.  This close to the subject  combined with the width of your subject''s DOF make too much of the time piece out of focus.  5 Swash</td>', 'High angle shots can increase the interest in a photo, but the LCD screen seems ghosted (were you going for that effect? Title doesn''t suggest it)  Background is nicely blurred out, but still enough going on to confuse.  This close to the subject  combined with the width of your subject''s DOF make too much of the time piece out of focus.  5 Swash', '2003-03-26 16:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
