(247030, 15016, 7187, '<td valign="top">I get it!  A paper chain is something that people (mostly kids) make around the holidays to count down the days till Christmas.  On Dec 1st they make a paper chain using 25 "rings" and each day, they tear a ring off so they''ll know how many days until Christmas; thus, counting down the days(time).  (I looked it up on google.)</td>', 'I get it!  A paper chain is something that people (mostly kids) make around the holidays to count down the days till Christmas.  On Dec 1st they make a paper chain using 25 "rings" and each day, they tear a ring off so they''ll know how many days until Christmas; thus, counting down the days(time).  (I looked it up on google.)', '2003-03-26 18:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
