(247090, 15839, 4829, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of biased, being a fellow jeeper myself :O) So I can understand the picute, perhaps more than others, lol! :::wave::::</td>', 'I''m kind of biased, being a fellow jeeper myself :O) So I can understand the picute, perhaps more than others, lol! :::wave::::', '2003-03-26 22:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(247095, 15941, 4829, '<td valign="top">AWESOME picture! Great timing! -8-</td>', 'AWESOME picture! Great timing! -8-', '2003-03-26 22:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(247107, 15866, 6597, '<td valign="top">the different shades of blue are effective</td>', 'the different shades of blue are effective', '2003-03-26 22:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(247112, 15888, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and soft focus here. If anyone tells you the focus is off, they are, in my mind, mistaking out of focus with "soft focus." I hope this image does well.</td>', 'I like the tones and soft focus here. If anyone tells you the focus is off, they are, in my mind, mistaking out of focus with "soft focus." I hope this image does well.', '2003-03-26 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(247122, 15644, 5822, '<td valign="top">I find the glare coming off the floor, as well as, the darker plank of wood in the upper left corner to be distracting. Shooting the subject at an alternative angle can help to get rid of those reflections</td>', 'I find the glare coming off the floor, as well as, the darker plank of wood in the upper left corner to be distracting. Shooting the subject at an alternative angle can help to get rid of those reflections', '2003-03-26 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(247138, 15333, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective and tones in this image.Very nice evocation of time for me.Things seem a bit out of focus, when I feel that in this case they should be in focus--but that light! That light on the stones! Wow!</td>', 'I love the perspective and tones in this image.Very nice evocation of time for me.Things seem a bit out of focus, when I feel that in this case they should be in focus--but that light! That light on the stones! Wow!', '2003-03-26 23:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(247139, 15641, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective here. I love how the vertical lines are augmented by the diagonals! The light is a bit harsh, but this is a very clear photo.</td>', 'Very nice perspective here. I love how the vertical lines are augmented by the diagonals! The light is a bit harsh, but this is a very clear photo.', '2003-03-26 23:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(247140, 15946, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nifty perspective here. The close-up is a great idea. I love the colors and tones, too. With only the small section of the minute hand in focus, it looks bent. Kinda makes me wish more were in focus, like the sharpness of the numbers. I like how it goes slowly out of focus toward the bottom right, but the tip of both hands could use sharpness. Anyway, very striking.</td>', 'Really nifty perspective here. The close-up is a great idea. I love the colors and tones, too. With only the small section of the minute hand in focus, it looks bent. Kinda makes me wish more were in focus, like the sharpness of the numbers. I like how it goes slowly out of focus toward the bottom right, but the tip of both hands could use sharpness. Anyway, very striking.', '2003-03-26 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(247146, 15848, 6548, '<td valign="top">amen</td>', 'amen', '2003-03-26 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(247148, 15728, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intriguing! I didn''t know a Greenwich Time Ball even existed! I''m not even sure of its function. but I do like how the tree on the right counterpoints the tower on the left.</td>', 'Intriguing! I didn''t know a Greenwich Time Ball even existed! I''m not even sure of its function. but I do like how the tree on the right counterpoints the tower on the left.', '2003-03-27 00:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(247151, 15539, 6548, '<td valign="top">now that says "time". nice photo</td>', 'now that says "time". nice photo', '2003-03-27 00:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(247153, 15725, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting clock! You capture this engaging clock in a very straightforward manner. I''m not sure of the function of the lamp at left, though. It does add interest, but I would think my interest should be on the clock itself while the lamps gets a lot more than its due share here. Anway, I like this shot and how it is placed in its environment. Ausgezeichnet!</td>', 'Very interesting clock! You capture this engaging clock in a very straightforward manner. I''m not sure of the function of the lamp at left, though. It does add interest, but I would think my interest should be on the clock itself while the lamps gets a lot more than its due share here. Anway, I like this shot and how it is placed in its environment. Ausgezeichnet!', '2003-03-27 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(247154, 15696, 6548, '<td valign="top">good timing, pardon the pun...</td>', 'good timing, pardon the pun...', '2003-03-27 00:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(247155, 15869, 6870, '<td valign="top">While I do find this photo a bit bright/light in tone, I love how you''ve managed to show this old wagon''s place in time. Marvelous approach!</td>', 'While I do find this photo a bit bright/light in tone, I love how you''ve managed to show this old wagon''s place in time. Marvelous approach!', '2003-03-27 00:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(247156, 15775, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love this photo because it makes me want more information, yet I feel it has enough to stand on its own. Nice work.</td>', 'I love this photo because it makes me want more information, yet I feel it has enough to stand on its own. Nice work.', '2003-03-27 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(247157, 15760, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the colors here. I wish the hands were in focus, and the numbers. This does not seem like a "soft focus" image. Nice use of light and tone!</td>', 'I love the colors here. I wish the hands were in focus, and the numbers. This does not seem like a "soft focus" image. Nice use of light and tone!', '2003-03-27 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(247158, 15779, 6548, '<td valign="top">wow! nice and crisp</td>', 'wow! nice and crisp', '2003-03-27 00:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(247159, 15510, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sharp and relevant to the theme. I find that the water tower gets far more attention than the plane, though. I would think that you would want to find ways to give the plane more attention. I like the perspective of the plane itself, too, and your lighting is just right.</td>', 'Sharp and relevant to the theme. I find that the water tower gets far more attention than the plane, though. I would think that you would want to find ways to give the plane more attention. I like the perspective of the plane itself, too, and your lighting is just right.', '2003-03-27 00:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(247161, 15959, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun image with the metronome and guitar together. I love the motion blur of the metronome. Lighting is just right, too.</td>', 'Fun image with the metronome and guitar together. I love the motion blur of the metronome. Lighting is just right, too.', '2003-03-27 00:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(247162, 15332, 6870, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus, but this is an interesting watch and I like it''s positioning within the frame.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus, but this is an interesting watch and I like it''s positioning within the frame.', '2003-03-27 00:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(247163, 15945, 6870, '<td valign="top">A nice pastiche of images. The hourglass is a particularly good touch. This is an informative image, and of course relevant to both Time and our time.</td>', 'A nice pastiche of images. The hourglass is a particularly good touch. This is an informative image, and of course relevant to both Time and our time.', '2003-03-27 00:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(247164, 15799, 6548, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo, every aspect of it. it doesn''t shout "time" to me, it just kinda whispers it, nonetheless, highest score so far:)</td>', 'I really love this photo, every aspect of it. it doesn''t shout "time" to me, it just kinda whispers it, nonetheless, highest score so far:)', '2003-03-27 00:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(247166, 15550, 6870, '<td valign="top">A fun photo and title. My eyes drift toward the interesting windows, though, when I feel they should end up on the officer. Perhaps if he was in focus and with a tighter crop: but then the photo would be uninteresting. Hmmm....</td>', 'A fun photo and title. My eyes drift toward the interesting windows, though, when I feel they should end up on the officer. Perhaps if he was in focus and with a tighter crop: but then the photo would be uninteresting. Hmmm....', '2003-03-27 00:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(247167, 15940, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice grainy image. The grain here communicates the desolate nature of the space. Window highlights are a wonderful addition.</td>', 'Nice grainy image. The grain here communicates the desolate nature of the space. Window highlights are a wonderful addition.', '2003-03-27 00:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(247168, 15936, 6548, '<td valign="top">with the right cropping this photo could pass as symmetry:)</td>', 'with the right cropping this photo could pass as symmetry:)', '2003-03-27 00:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(247169, 15915, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very effective image. The simple B/W works well here.</td>', 'Very simple, very effective image. The simple B/W works well here.', '2003-03-27 00:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(247170, 15474, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image. the open lid at left is a very nice touch.</td>', 'Intriguing image. the open lid at left is a very nice touch.', '2003-03-27 00:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(247171, 15772, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and colors here. The half circle on the lighter background and then framed in black is really wonderful and makes this photo a looker.</td>', 'I love the tones and colors here. The half circle on the lighter background and then framed in black is really wonderful and makes this photo a looker.', '2003-03-27 00:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(247173, 15958, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very intimate feel to this image, so the close up is very appropriate. The title makes this image really hit home. I''d like to see this with more interesting light, perhaps, but this brings up a wonderful array of emotions for me, so I consider it a good photo.</td>', 'Very intimate feel to this image, so the close up is very appropriate. The title makes this image really hit home. I''d like to see this with more interesting light, perhaps, but this brings up a wonderful array of emotions for me, so I consider it a good photo.', '2003-03-27 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(247177, 15793, 6548, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty cool, I like the reflection.</td>', 'that''s pretty cool, I like the reflection.', '2003-03-27 00:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(247189, 15549, 2937, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the link to the challenge, but I love the colours (specially the green grass!)</td>', 'I don''t see the link to the challenge, but I love the colours (specially the green grass!)', '2003-03-27 02:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(247191, 15641, 5792, '<td valign="top">Grey against deep blue is beautiful. Nice composition.</td>', 'Grey against deep blue is beautiful. Nice composition.', '2003-03-27 02:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(247192, 15806, 2937, '<td valign="top">That a 100 bugs fine, where I come from :-) Perfect timing, congrats.</td>', 'That a 100 bugs fine, where I come from :-) Perfect timing, congrats.', '2003-03-27 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(247193, 15416, 2937, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but where the clue to the challenge?</td>', 'Nice shot, but where the clue to the challenge?', '2003-03-27 02:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(247196, 15895, 6172, '<td valign="top">pun intended</td>', 'pun intended', '2003-03-27 02:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(247197, 15845, 6172, '<td valign="top">Why all the bluish tint?  It destroys the clarity of the picture.</td>', 'Why all the bluish tint?  It destroys the clarity of the picture.', '2003-03-27 02:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(247204, 15875, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wanted to get a shot like this myself - but didn''t. This is good - though I''d love to see some motion in it. Good shooting.</td>', 'Wanted to get a shot like this myself - but didn''t. This is good - though I''d love to see some motion in it. Good shooting.', '2003-03-27 04:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(247207, 15797, 4472, '<td valign="top">2/3 ofd the image is out of focus and irrelivant</td>', '2/3 ofd the image is out of focus and irrelivant', '2003-03-27 05:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(247208, 15911, 4472, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W, well exposed</td>', 'Nice use of B&W, well exposed', '2003-03-27 05:05:55.000000', NULL, 1);
