(247227, 15224, 5892, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, and I keep coming back to it. It almost feels haunting. Good choices made.</td>', 'I really like this shot, and I keep coming back to it. It almost feels haunting. Good choices made.', '2003-03-27 05:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
