(247230, 15549, 5892, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, rich colors. A perfect shot.</td>', 'Beautiful, rich colors. A perfect shot.', '2003-03-27 05:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(247231, 15913, 4472, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W does nothing here, and everything is laning to the left</td>', 'B&W does nothing here, and everything is laning to the left', '2003-03-27 05:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(247232, 15907, 4472, '<td valign="top">Very dark</td>', 'Very dark', '2003-03-27 05:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(247234, 15872, 3746, '<td valign="top">I''m not really voting this week as I dont have the time, but this photo REALLY caught my eye, I just hope people see the significance of the sundial onthe tree-rings..<br/>Great shot, hopefuly top3...   marksimms</td>', 'I''m not really voting this week as I dont have the time, but this photo REALLY caught my eye, I just hope people see the significance of the sundial onthe tree-rings..Great shot, hopefuly top3...   marksimms', '2003-03-27 05:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(247248, 15974, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I love the contrast of those two colors, they complement each other very well.</td>', 'Nice composition, I love the contrast of those two colors, they complement each other very well.', '2003-03-27 08:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(247263, 15883, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the yellow in this photo, but the focus on your main flower is a bit soft... this is an interesting problem because it seems that the woodwork under the flower is in good sharp focus... - setzler</td>', 'I love the yellow in this photo, but the focus on your main flower is a bit soft... this is an interesting problem because it seems that the woodwork under the flower is in good sharp focus... - setzler', '2003-03-27 09:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(247265, 15906, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo has a really neat quality to it... the composition is excellent.  I seem to really like the way I can see your camera reflection in this image... just as a side note, I think working the ''camera'' into the title of this shot could have been fun also... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'This photo has a really neat quality to it... the composition is excellent.  I seem to really like the way I can see your camera reflection in this image... just as a side note, I think working the ''camera'' into the title of this shot could have been fun also... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-27 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(247268, 15561, 6530, '<td valign="top">very precious photo.  You may want to go back in and try using an unsharping mask, it appears a bit soft, and that will bring the focus in better.</td>', 'very precious photo.  You may want to go back in and try using an unsharping mask, it appears a bit soft, and that will bring the focus in better.', '2003-03-27 10:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(247269, 15763, 1779, '<td valign="top">está muy padre. si tan sólo estuviera centrada...<br/> <br/>no te creas.<br/> <br/>se ve muy bien. lo único que me gubiera gustado es que la velicidad estuviera representada más dramáticamete, es decir, que no fuera tan rápido el obturador para que inclusive se moviera un poco hasta el carro.<br/> <br/>la composición está perfecta y el foco, impresionante.<br/> <br/>q se jodan estos pendejos.</td>', 'está muy padre. si tan sólo estuviera centrada... no te creas. se ve muy bien. lo único que me gubiera gustado es que la velicidad estuviera representada más dramáticamete, es decir, que no fuera tan rápido el obturador para que inclusive se moviera un poco hasta el carro. la composición está perfecta y el foco, impresionante. q se jodan estos pendejos.', '2003-03-27 10:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(247270, 15956, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is really nice... parts of this picture are over-exposed, but i still like it very much... the mood it sets is undeniable... maybe is it was a little darker it''d be even better... 8</td>', 'this is really nice... parts of this picture are over-exposed, but i still like it very much... the mood it sets is undeniable... maybe is it was a little darker it''d be even better... 8', '2003-03-27 10:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(247279, 15863, 6783, '<td valign="top">good idea, but the shoot should have been studied a bit more.</td>', 'good idea, but the shoot should have been studied a bit more.', '2003-03-27 10:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(247280, 15739, 6783, '<td valign="top">Very suggestive.</td>', 'Very suggestive.', '2003-03-27 10:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(247283, 15539, 6783, '<td valign="top">I think your photo is very original. I like it.</td>', 'I think your photo is very original. I like it.', '2003-03-27 10:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(247287, 15747, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF, wonderful composure and great idea on top!</td>', 'Excellent DOF, wonderful composure and great idea on top!', '2003-03-27 11:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(247288, 15845, 6597, '<td valign="top">like the color well arranged</td>', 'like the color well arranged', '2003-03-27 11:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(247289, 15483, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now how did you do that? The second hand is still while the minute hand is moving. Good illusion, well done. Can''t wait to see the description.</td>', 'Now how did you do that? The second hand is still while the minute hand is moving. Good illusion, well done. Can''t wait to see the description.', '2003-03-27 11:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(247290, 15907, 5822, '<td valign="top">Appears underexposed to me.</td>', 'Appears underexposed to me.', '2003-03-27 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(247291, 15876, 6597, '<td valign="top">well arranged cute good color</td>', 'well arranged cute good color', '2003-03-27 11:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(247292, 15851, 6597, '<td valign="top">good but I would have liked the house a little larger</td>', 'good but I would have liked the house a little larger', '2003-03-27 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(247296, 15802, 7359, '<td valign="top">this photograph is very interesting</td>', 'this photograph is very interesting', '2003-03-27 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(247300, 15768, 3459, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, low key, yet colourful composition.  Excellent work a 10!</td>', 'This is a wonderful, low key, yet colourful composition.  Excellent work a 10!', '2003-03-27 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(247301, 15163, 3459, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this photograph, I think it is an incredible peace of work.  Perfect a 10!</td>', 'I love the feel of this photograph, I think it is an incredible peace of work.  Perfect a 10!', '2003-03-27 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(247303, 15940, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great use of existing light, the pattern and angle of the lines add strength to the image; B&amp;W was a perfect choice as well. Exceptional!</td>', 'Great use of existing light, the pattern and angle of the lines add strength to the image; B&W was a perfect choice as well. Exceptional!', '2003-03-27 11:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(247307, 15809, 1204, '<td valign="top">Here on DPC I guess this is called a "Setzler type of shot".  Nevertheless, well executed.  I like this narrow DOF.</td>', 'Here on DPC I guess this is called a "Setzler type of shot".  Nevertheless, well executed.  I like this narrow DOF.', '2003-03-27 12:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(247311, 15774, 1204, '<td valign="top">In my oppinion the crop is to tight but I guess there is a reason.  How worn out the meter is makes this photo work, it gives the "time expired" a deeper meaning.  Good idea but nothing fascinating about the execution or setup (e.g. the busy background, the shadow on the left and reflection on glass).  I however often like those point&amp;shoot''s better than studio set-ups.  A polarizer might have done the trick though.</td>', 'In my oppinion the crop is to tight but I guess there is a reason.  How worn out the meter is makes this photo work, it gives the "time expired" a deeper meaning.  Good idea but nothing fascinating about the execution or setup (e.g. the busy background, the shadow on the left and reflection on glass).  I however often like those point&shoot''s better than studio set-ups.  A polarizer might have done the trick though.', '2003-03-27 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(247312, 15777, 7217, '<td valign="top">Intersting picture, took a couple of looks to realize that the hands of the clock were off.</td>', 'Intersting picture, took a couple of looks to realize that the hands of the clock were off.', '2003-03-27 12:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(247313, 15843, 7217, '<td valign="top">Play on words? Nice photo though, seems like the flower(?) on the left is the one which is mostly in focus.</td>', 'Play on words? Nice photo though, seems like the flower(?) on the left is the one which is mostly in focus.', '2003-03-27 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(247314, 15976, 7217, '<td valign="top">Nice photo (for a play on words!). I like the color of the flower with the darker blue/purplish background.</td>', 'Nice photo (for a play on words!). I like the color of the flower with the darker blue/purplish background.', '2003-03-27 12:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(247315, 15331, 1204, '<td valign="top">I shall admit that studio setups often do not appeal to me as much as real-life photos.  But when there is a studio setup, you get more critical about details and the reflections in the hourglass bother me, I must say.  As soon as you see this photo you try to figure out the reflections and the beuty of the "big picture" is kind of lost.  Do not take me too seriously though, I''m rating this at 7 ;)</td>', 'I shall admit that studio setups often do not appeal to me as much as real-life photos.  But when there is a studio setup, you get more critical about details and the reflections in the hourglass bother me, I must say.  As soon as you see this photo you try to figure out the reflections and the beuty of the "big picture" is kind of lost.  Do not take me too seriously though, I''m rating this at 7 ;)', '2003-03-27 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
