(247322, 15839, 1204, '<td valign="top">I do share your joy and this is photo has a lot to give.  I can almost feel the fun you had.  But the connection to the challege is a bit far-fetched.  I rate this a 7 - is the challenge had been "fun" or "good time" you would get a 10.</td>', 'I do share your joy and this is photo has a lot to give.  I can almost feel the fun you had.  But the connection to the challege is a bit far-fetched.  I rate this a 7 - is the challenge had been "fun" or "good time" you would get a 10.', '2003-03-27 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(247324, 15224, 1204, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what you''re trying to achive, I must say...  Do those things (rings?) in upper left corner play a role?  If so, why are the cropped and so much out of focus, if not why are they there?    Actually this gives my an idea though, wedding rings in the upper right corner, in focus, with the digital alarm fading out bootom right - this could have worked.</td>', 'I am not sure what you''re trying to achive, I must say...  Do those things (rings?) in upper left corner play a role?  If so, why are the cropped and so much out of focus, if not why are they there?    Actually this gives my an idea though, wedding rings in the upper right corner, in focus, with the digital alarm fading out bootom right - this could have worked.', '2003-03-27 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
