(247343, 15842, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. My only 2 cents addition to this would be to crop the top down just above the tail light. I think the boost in color is a good addition to this, but the composition has so much red in it, it seems to take my eyes away from the more interesting areas of the artwork. so... I''m only giving you a  9-3/4 ... rounded to the nearest number.... = 10     nice work.</td>', 'This is a great shot. My only 2 cents addition to this would be to crop the top down just above the tail light. I think the boost in color is a good addition to this, but the composition has so much red in it, it seems to take my eyes away from the more interesting areas of the artwork. so... I''m only giving you a  9-3/4 ... rounded to the nearest number.... = 10     nice work.', '2003-03-27 14:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
