(247648, 15748, 3972, '<td valign="top">What a stand-out image. I love the contrast between the NATURAL stark wintry tree reflections (nd the LEAVING leaves whosing their own count on chronology)  on (the glass table top ?) and the warmth of the CULTURAL pocket-watch.<br/> <br/>It looks even BETTER if you stand back from it a bit.... <br/> <br/>Not absoluely rigidly sure about the positioning because the chain going off shot nags me to follow it but I can''t..... Nevertheless I think this would make a great advertising poster and give a 9/10.</td>', 'What a stand-out image. I love the contrast between the NATURAL stark wintry tree reflections (nd the LEAVING leaves whosing their own count on chronology)  on (the glass table top ?) and the warmth of the CULTURAL pocket-watch. It looks even BETTER if you stand back from it a bit....  Not absoluely rigidly sure about the positioning because the chain going off shot nags me to follow it but I can''t..... Nevertheless I think this would make a great advertising poster and give a 9/10.', '2003-03-28 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
