(248031, 15549, 6999, '<td valign="top">Would love to know exactly what is done to get this intense colour, and the detail at all levels of light. It looks painted, almost.  Something feels wrong with it, and I can''t put my finger on it. It''s a great shot though - reminiscent, compositionally, of Parr''s famous shot of Glastonbury Torr.</td>', 'Would love to know exactly what is done to get this intense colour, and the detail at all levels of light. It looks painted, almost.  Something feels wrong with it, and I can''t put my finger on it. It''s a great shot though - reminiscent, compositionally, of Parr''s famous shot of Glastonbury Torr.', '2003-03-28 20:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(248035, 15906, 6325, '<td valign="top">Unique shot.</td>', 'Unique shot.', '2003-03-28 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
