(248039, 15737, 6325, '<td valign="top">Tried to figure out location from the distance between marks, but I could not do it. Guessing above 45 deg. Where is it? <br/>Nice shot. Uniform gray with the black marking and lettering is nice.</td>', 'Tried to figure out location from the distance between marks, but I could not do it. Guessing above 45 deg. Where is it? Nice shot. Uniform gray with the black marking and lettering is nice.', '2003-03-28 21:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
