(248048, 15823, 6325, '<td valign="top">Someplace in Texas. I''m getting out to do the Blues this weekend. Nice mixture of flowers and greenery. Focus could have been sharper for me.</td>', 'Someplace in Texas. I''m getting out to do the Blues this weekend. Nice mixture of flowers and greenery. Focus could have been sharper for me.', '2003-03-28 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
