(248167, 15747, 6520, '<td valign="top">Great idea. You would have gotten top marks but you lose all the extra for the poor focus. Had great potential. I don`t know if you are trying to show more time has expired with the more eaten apples but this in my opinion is totaly unnessesary. The light green border is not a help either! An apple lover</td>', 'Great idea. You would have gotten top marks but you lose all the extra for the poor focus. Had great potential. I don`t know if you are trying to show more time has expired with the more eaten apples but this in my opinion is totaly unnessesary. The light green border is not a help either! An apple lover', '2003-03-29 09:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(248170, 15747, 4049, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about the blur as it goes toward the right... and you should have put lime or lemon juice to keep the fruit from turning brown. It''s a good idea though. And I like the framing.</td>', 'I don''t know about the blur as it goes toward the right... and you should have put lime or lemon juice to keep the fruit from turning brown. It''s a good idea though. And I like the framing.', '2003-03-29 09:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
