(248182, 15348, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but a bit too subtle. Took me a while to notice the blurred hand.</td>', 'Nice idea, but a bit too subtle. Took me a while to notice the blurred hand.', '2003-03-29 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
