(248323, 15748, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and lovely idea. The result is a superb image. I can''t think of any suggestions for improvement. Sorry. This must be the perfect photo. 10<br/> <br/>Okay, it''s been several days and I still can''t think of any suggestions for improvement. It truly is the perfect photograph. Consider me now your disciple. I kneel at your feet to learn O'' Wise One.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and lovely idea. The result is a superb image. I can''t think of any suggestions for improvement. Sorry. This must be the perfect photo. 10 Okay, it''s been several days and I still can''t think of any suggestions for improvement. It truly is the perfect photograph. Consider me now your disciple. I kneel at your feet to learn O'' Wise One.', '2003-03-29 19:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(248349, 15945, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is very interesting - actually, i had the same idea, even with the hourglass, took some pictures, but then decided to go with something completely different... i thought i''d title it "time is up" -but that''s enough about me, your picture looks very original in the long run... 8</td>', 'this is very interesting - actually, i had the same idea, even with the hourglass, took some pictures, but then decided to go with something completely different... i thought i''d title it "time is up" -but that''s enough about me, your picture looks very original in the long run... 8', '2003-03-29 21:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(248350, 15333, 1570, '<td valign="top">how morbid................</td>', 'how morbid................', '2003-03-29 21:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(248363, 15766, 7601, '<td valign="top">Awesome.. This is a photo I would buy if i saw it in a shop!!</td>', 'Awesome.. This is a photo I would buy if i saw it in a shop!!', '2003-03-29 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
