(248367, 15162, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! This is a very clever shot. The noise doesn''t really bother me here, in this type of shot I think it fits. The only thing that I would change is the washer in the fore ground, it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nicely done! This is a very clever shot. The noise doesn''t really bother me here, in this type of shot I think it fits. The only thing that I would change is the washer in the fore ground, it''s a bit distracting.', '2003-03-29 22:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(248368, 15907, 616, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that B&amp;W is used here, but it seems to be a little on the dark side. Other than having better lighting, nice job.</td>', 'I like the fact that B&W is used here, but it seems to be a little on the dark side. Other than having better lighting, nice job.', '2003-03-29 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(248370, 15888, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think I would prefer to see more of the stand below the clock, but I like the space used above the clock as well.  I wonder how this would look zoomed out a bit.  Good use of sepia tone and soft focus.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think I would prefer to see more of the stand below the clock, but I like the space used above the clock as well.  I wonder how this would look zoomed out a bit.  Good use of sepia tone and soft focus.', '2003-03-29 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(248371, 15959, 616, '<td valign="top">nicely done. Great subjects. I was wondering why the guitar was included into the shot, but I like the fact that it is included. Without the guitar this shot would be a bit bland.</td>', 'nicely done. Great subjects. I was wondering why the guitar was included into the shot, but I like the fact that it is included. Without the guitar this shot would be a bit bland.', '2003-03-29 22:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(248372, 15966, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the connection to the challenge, but this is a very interesting image.  It almost has a surreal look to it, nice job.  I think this image would best fit a "free study" type challenge.  - 4 - Mav</td>', 'I don''t really understand the connection to the challenge, but this is a very interesting image.  It almost has a surreal look to it, nice job.  I think this image would best fit a "free study" type challenge.  - 4 - Mav', '2003-03-29 22:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(248373, 15459, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is intentional or not, but the image shows a lot of compression.  The resolution seems up to the challenge though, so I''m not sure this is a result of your camera.  To me, it detracts from the image.  The white balance is also a bit off, showing a greenish color cast.  Lastly, your choice of framing is interesting, but I think it is cropped a bit too tight on the sides.  Good idea, though.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is intentional or not, but the image shows a lot of compression.  The resolution seems up to the challenge though, so I''m not sure this is a result of your camera.  To me, it detracts from the image.  The white balance is also a bit off, showing a greenish color cast.  Lastly, your choice of framing is interesting, but I think it is cropped a bit too tight on the sides.  Good idea, though.', '2003-03-29 22:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(248376, 15766, 616, '<td valign="top">nicely done! My only suggestion would have been to crop out the other yellow filled in objects to the left and bottom, just to keep the focus on the lovely flower. But only if the file size was large enough. It''s not a major issue, but it just hits me because i''m obessive conpulsive.</td>', 'nicely done! My only suggestion would have been to crop out the other yellow filled in objects to the left and bottom, just to keep the focus on the lovely flower. But only if the file size was large enough. It''s not a major issue, but it just hits me because i''m obessive conpulsive.', '2003-03-29 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(248377, 15779, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! You''ve got a real incredible subject here. I like the fact that this shot shows the ravages of time. The only thing that I would suggest to be changed is the composition/framing of the building. Being a bit more centered might have fit in better.</td>', 'Nicely done! You''ve got a real incredible subject here. I like the fact that this shot shows the ravages of time. The only thing that I would suggest to be changed is the composition/framing of the building. Being a bit more centered might have fit in better.', '2003-03-29 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(248379, 15895, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Composition here is great. The decision to make the subject over saturated and have high contrats was good. It makes your submition stand out. Plus you have done it were the over saturation and contrast isn''t over powering, it works perfectly with your subjets.</td>', 'Nicely done. Composition here is great. The decision to make the subject over saturated and have high contrats was good. It makes your submition stand out. Plus you have done it were the over saturation and contrast isn''t over powering, it works perfectly with your subjets.', '2003-03-29 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(248381, 15891, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The way which you have executed this technique is great. The angle which this was taken was a very nice touch and makes your entry stand out.</td>', 'Nicely done! The way which you have executed this technique is great. The angle which this was taken was a very nice touch and makes your entry stand out.', '2003-03-29 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(248384, 15308, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicley done! I really like the framing technique that you used here.</td>', 'Nicley done! I really like the framing technique that you used here.', '2003-03-29 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(248385, 15584, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the subject.  In my opinion, sepia tone works well in putting forth the feeling of late winter, but would benefit from a bit more saturation; sky seems a tad overexposed; sharpening effects are a bit too pronounced in the branches and trunks of the trees.... but just my opinions!</td>', 'Nice approach to the subject.  In my opinion, sepia tone works well in putting forth the feeling of late winter, but would benefit from a bit more saturation; sky seems a tad overexposed; sharpening effects are a bit too pronounced in the branches and trunks of the trees.... but just my opinions!', '2003-03-29 22:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(248388, 15808, 7033, '<td valign="top">Pretty eclectic shot!  Overall, works quite well; rich color really complements the shot.  Softer focus on the rock formations doesn''t work quite as well, in my opinion, but it would be tough to do much more and still keep the clock in focus.  Overall, quite nicely done.</td>', 'Pretty eclectic shot!  Overall, works quite well; rich color really complements the shot.  Softer focus on the rock formations doesn''t work quite as well, in my opinion, but it would be tough to do much more and still keep the clock in focus.  Overall, quite nicely done.', '2003-03-29 22:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(248390, 15842, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice approach to the challenge!  Feeling of time and aging is definitely conveyed by the rusting vehicle and mangled license plate.  Quite nicely done!</td>', 'Nice approach to the challenge!  Feeling of time and aging is definitely conveyed by the rusting vehicle and mangled license plate.  Quite nicely done!', '2003-03-29 22:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(248391, 15970, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and a fantastic take on the challenge!  Not only is time captured in the hourglass, it is captured in each separate position in the frame.  Well done!</td>', 'Great shot, and a fantastic take on the challenge!  Not only is time captured in the hourglass, it is captured in each separate position in the frame.  Well done!', '2003-03-29 23:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
