(248607, 15346, 509, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is stretched a bit here.  I think the image would be more effective if you could have found an older car (50''s era or older) and compared it with a newer car (the cars there are neither very old or very new...)  I think the image is also cropped too tight on the left.  Nice idea, but I think it could be improved.</td>', 'I think the idea is stretched a bit here.  I think the image would be more effective if you could have found an older car (50''s era or older) and compared it with a newer car (the cars there are neither very old or very new...)  I think the image is also cropped too tight on the left.  Nice idea, but I think it could be improved.', '2003-03-30 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(248609, 15957, 509, '<td valign="top">I usually wake up in a cold sweat when I have morning exams, so I know how this feels!  Nice job, the only thing I find off here is the color balance, it seems a bit bland and I would have preferred a wider aperture, to meke the person on the bed slightly out of focus.</td>', 'I usually wake up in a cold sweat when I have morning exams, so I know how this feels!  Nice job, the only thing I find off here is the color balance, it seems a bit bland and I would have preferred a wider aperture, to meke the person on the bed slightly out of focus.', '2003-03-30 15:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
