(248692, 15799, 806, '<td valign="top">now THIS is cool! love the abstract of it,.. love the colors, .. love the theme.. the execution... this shows ingenuity behind the camera. How did you ever get the bell shadow? you must be holding it from behind the camera? very interesting image.</td>', 'now THIS is cool! love the abstract of it,.. love the colors, .. love the theme.. the execution... this shows ingenuity behind the camera. How did you ever get the bell shadow? you must be holding it from behind the camera? very interesting image.', '2003-03-30 21:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(248694, 15696, 7613, '<td valign="top">Nice one, great composition!!</td>', 'Nice one, great composition!!', '2003-03-30 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(248695, 15187, 806, '<td valign="top">the contrast of themes in this photo are striking. first the people are sipping thier coffee.. seemingly casually. But.. outside the window there is so much activity.. and adrenaline.. expectation.. emotion. Does everyone sit idly by like this while the whir of time and the world passes by?<br/>Congratulations for making such an emotional image.. not because of the current events, but because it speaks volumes. I hope it has not been lost on others...<br/>BTW... amazing exposure.. as you didn''t completely wash out the outside as it was brighter than the inside of the room. I''d love to see your settings.<br/>This is a favorite this week, and I don''t have them every week.</td>', 'the contrast of themes in this photo are striking. first the people are sipping thier coffee.. seemingly casually. But.. outside the window there is so much activity.. and adrenaline.. expectation.. emotion. Does everyone sit idly by like this while the whir of time and the world passes by?Congratulations for making such an emotional image.. not because of the current events, but because it speaks volumes. I hope it has not been lost on others...BTW... amazing exposure.. as you didn''t completely wash out the outside as it was brighter than the inside of the room. I''d love to see your settings.This is a favorite this week, and I don''t have them every week.', '2003-03-30 21:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(248696, 14970, 7613, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why I like this....but I do!</td>', 'I don''t know why I like this....but I do!', '2003-03-30 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
