(248821, 15946, 4877, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  Beautiful colours, and nice elegant clock as the subject.  I like the effect you have got there with the depth of field.  I think it would also look good with the entire clock hands in focus.  But either way, its really nice!<br/> <br/>One of my top 5 for the week!  Good luck!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  Beautiful colours, and nice elegant clock as the subject.  I like the effect you have got there with the depth of field.  I think it would also look good with the entire clock hands in focus.  But either way, its really nice! One of my top 5 for the week!  Good luck!', '2003-03-30 23:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(248822, 15794, 4877, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I realy like the effect you have created in this shot!  Great lighting, and really good clock as the subject.  The shadow on the left of the clock is a little off putting, but overall it is beautiful!  <br/> <br/>One of my top 5 for the week!  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow!  I realy like the effect you have created in this shot!  Great lighting, and really good clock as the subject.  The shadow on the left of the clock is a little off putting, but overall it is beautiful!   One of my top 5 for the week!  Good luck!', '2003-03-30 23:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(248825, 15955, 4877, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Intricate, very well composed, great lighting, and I love the blue contrasting with the interest generated by the clock itself.  Cant really suggest anything to change about the shot!<br/> <br/>One of my top 5 for the week.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow!  Intricate, very well composed, great lighting, and I love the blue contrasting with the interest generated by the clock itself.  Cant really suggest anything to change about the shot! One of my top 5 for the week.  Good luck!', '2003-03-30 23:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(248828, 15768, 4877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I''m glad to see a great shot which shows the thought you have put into it.  I love the colours, texture and lighting you have been able to capture in this stunning photo.  A submission without a clock in my top 5 for the week!  Well done, and good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I''m glad to see a great shot which shows the thought you have put into it.  I love the colours, texture and lighting you have been able to capture in this stunning photo.  A submission without a clock in my top 5 for the week!  Well done, and good luck!', '2003-03-30 23:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(248830, 15748, 4877, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Amazing effect with the reflection surrounding the clock.  Beautiful timepeice, and very well composed.  Great lighting.  Cant suggest any improvements.  Really well done!  <br/> <br/>One of my top 5 this week!  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow.  Amazing effect with the reflection surrounding the clock.  Beautiful timepeice, and very well composed.  Great lighting.  Cant suggest any improvements.  Really well done!   One of my top 5 this week!  Good luck!', '2003-03-30 23:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(248831, 15612, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice abstract... the color tone also sets it off nicely... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a really nice abstract... the color tone also sets it off nicely... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-03-30 23:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(248845, 15549, 7067, '<td valign="top">This is picture perfect!  Ah how much I''d love to be here at the moment.  Love the idyllic clouds and the gentle wind blown grass.  I''m curious to see where this picture was taken.</td>', 'This is picture perfect!  Ah how much I''d love to be here at the moment.  Love the idyllic clouds and the gentle wind blown grass.  I''m curious to see where this picture was taken.', '2003-03-30 23:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(248849, 15958, 7067, '<td valign="top">This photo conveys how loved this darling stuffed animal was over the years.  Great texture, lighting and DOF.</td>', 'This photo conveys how loved this darling stuffed animal was over the years.  Great texture, lighting and DOF.', '2003-03-30 23:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(248851, 15187, 7067, '<td valign="top">This photograph makes a great statement.  B&amp;W conveys the mood beautifully, as does the mid-sip capture.  Good job!</td>', 'This photograph makes a great statement.  B&W conveys the mood beautifully, as does the mid-sip capture.  Good job!', '2003-03-30 23:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(248853, 15612, 5400, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2003-03-31 00:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(248854, 15483, 7067, '<td valign="top">Nice macro time exposure.  This travel clock (I had one like this until I knocked it off the table and broke it) makes a great subject with it''s green glow-in-the-dark highlights on the ends of the hour and minute hands.</td>', 'Nice macro time exposure.  This travel clock (I had one like this until I knocked it off the table and broke it) makes a great subject with it''s green glow-in-the-dark highlights on the ends of the hour and minute hands.', '2003-03-31 00:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(248855, 15800, 5400, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too much contrast here. Interesting perspective, though.</td>', 'I think there''s too much contrast here. Interesting perspective, though.', '2003-03-31 00:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(248856, 15677, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice title, and time is communicated without it, too. Everything seems just a bit out of focus, which i see is necessary in this shot. nice pattern contrast and good composition/framing/cropping.</td>', 'Nice title, and time is communicated without it, too. Everything seems just a bit out of focus, which i see is necessary in this shot. nice pattern contrast and good composition/framing/cropping.', '2003-03-31 00:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(248859, 15331, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the colors are appropriate to set off the brass and colored glass. Just a tad out of focus; perhaps a greater DOF would help. Great work here.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the colors are appropriate to set off the brass and colored glass. Just a tad out of focus; perhaps a greater DOF would help. Great work here.', '2003-03-31 00:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(248860, 15536, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful tones here. The sky is fabulous, but what really makes this image effective to me (the frosting on the cake) is the way the lacy branches echo the lettering of the clock. Delightful to look at. High marks from me.</td>', 'Simply wonderful tones here. The sky is fabulous, but what really makes this image effective to me (the frosting on the cake) is the way the lacy branches echo the lettering of the clock. Delightful to look at. High marks from me.', '2003-03-31 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(248863, 15950, 7067, '<td valign="top">Ahh, glorious spring time :)  Nice composition.  Only criticism is that the clock tower appears to be leaning to the right.  I would like to see the center line of the clock tower be vertical instead of the right line.</td>', 'Ahh, glorious spring time :)  Nice composition.  Only criticism is that the clock tower appears to be leaning to the right.  I would like to see the center line of the clock tower be vertical instead of the right line.', '2003-03-31 00:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(248864, 15757, 6943, '<td valign="top">Like you said...nice clock ;-) I like your treatment of this, well done</td>', 'Like you said...nice clock ;-) I like your treatment of this, well done', '2003-03-31 00:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(248868, 15808, 7067, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt the most imaginative picture in this challenge.  Great idea.  What a view!</td>', 'Without a doubt the most imaginative picture in this challenge.  Great idea.  What a view!', '2003-03-31 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(248869, 15763, 5947, '<td valign="top">Must be a great camera! Like this photo! Great how you got the action just right and still managed to get great sharpness! This ones a winner!<br/></td>', 'Must be a great camera! Like this photo! Great how you got the action just right and still managed to get great sharpness! This ones a winner!', '2003-03-31 00:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(248872, 15940, 7607, '<td valign="top">Well done..Gives new meaning to "time"</td>', 'Well done..Gives new meaning to "time"', '2003-03-31 00:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(248873, 15843, 7607, '<td valign="top">good focus and simplicity</td>', 'good focus and simplicity', '2003-03-31 00:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(248874, 15761, 7067, '<td valign="top">I like how you posed your models here.  It''s much more interesting that having both models face and look into the camera.  Lighting is good.  I also like how you paid attention to little details like what the models are wearing.  The jacket and tie on the elder model makes a striking contrast to the t-shirt on the young child, enforcing on us the generational differences.  Only thing I''d like to see changed is to be able to see the left eye of the elder model unobscurred.</td>', 'I like how you posed your models here.  It''s much more interesting that having both models face and look into the camera.  Lighting is good.  I also like how you paid attention to little details like what the models are wearing.  The jacket and tie on the elder model makes a striking contrast to the t-shirt on the young child, enforcing on us the generational differences.  Only thing I''d like to see changed is to be able to see the left eye of the elder model unobscurred.', '2003-03-31 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(248879, 15800, 7067, '<td valign="top">Different.  I like.  Are there actually two clocks here or double exposure?</td>', 'Different.  I like.  Are there actually two clocks here or double exposure?', '2003-03-31 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(248880, 15872, 7607, '<td valign="top">Nice...love these sun dials</td>', 'Nice...love these sun dials', '2003-03-31 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(248882, 15523, 7067, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of depth of focus.  Lighting and colours are good too.  Like the attention to detail in the positioning of the hands of the clock.  Lovely!</td>', 'Fantastic use of depth of focus.  Lighting and colours are good too.  Like the attention to detail in the positioning of the hands of the clock.  Lovely!', '2003-03-31 00:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(248884, 15659, 5947, '<td valign="top">Like this photo because it reminds me of what my room used to look like, back in the day!</td>', 'Like this photo because it reminds me of what my room used to look like, back in the day!', '2003-03-31 00:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(248886, 15893, 7607, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp but lacks a true subject for me</td>', 'Clean and crisp but lacks a true subject for me', '2003-03-31 00:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
