(248917, 15739, 7067, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but the green tint puts me off.</td>', 'I like this photo but the green tint puts me off.', '2003-03-31 00:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(248918, 15641, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the blue sky, and the details you have captured in the building.  My only comment would be to crop it a little closer on the left since it is "tight" on the right.  It feels a little off balanced to me.</td>', 'I love the blue sky, and the details you have captured in the building.  My only comment would be to crop it a little closer on the left since it is "tight" on the right.  It feels a little off balanced to me.', '2003-03-31 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(248919, 15774, 7607, '<td valign="top">do these still exsist? Good job.</td>', 'do these still exsist? Good job.', '2003-03-31 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(248920, 15109, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the happy expression on their face, and the naturalness of their pose.  Nice capture.</td>', 'I love the happy expression on their face, and the naturalness of their pose.  Nice capture.', '2003-03-31 00:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(248921, 15885, 7067, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea!  But didn''t have a stopwatch and didn''t know where to find a track so gave up on it.  Good interpretation and implementation.  Would like to see slightly greater DOF such that the runner is not so out of focus.</td>', 'I had the same idea!  But didn''t have a stopwatch and didn''t know where to find a track so gave up on it.  Good interpretation and implementation.  Would like to see slightly greater DOF such that the runner is not so out of focus.', '2003-03-31 00:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(248924, 15885, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome work.  I wanted to do this set up, but had none of the necessary elements except the stop watch!  The fingers look a little pink.  Maybe a bit of desaturation in the red (though you will lose some of the track''s brilliance), or convert it to bw.</td>', 'Awesome work.  I wanted to do this set up, but had none of the necessary elements except the stop watch!  The fingers look a little pink.  Maybe a bit of desaturation in the red (though you will lose some of the track''s brilliance), or convert it to bw.', '2003-03-31 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(248925, 15683, 7067, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers but doesn''t really convey Time to me.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers but doesn''t really convey Time to me.', '2003-03-31 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(248926, 15463, 811, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!  Took me a minute to see exactly what you had done here.  The 3 and 9 are difficult to because of the way the light is reflecting off of them.</td>', 'Great idea!!  Took me a minute to see exactly what you had done here.  The 3 and 9 are difficult to because of the way the light is reflecting off of them.', '2003-03-31 00:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(248927, 15332, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; quite nicely done.  Reflection at 10-o-clock is a bit distracting, but not overly so.</td>', 'Nice composition; quite nicely done.  Reflection at 10-o-clock is a bit distracting, but not overly so.', '2003-03-31 00:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(248929, 15761, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture.  I think the empty space is a bit too much though.  It is not enough to be effective negative space, but too much to be a "margin" of sorts, especially since the right is cropped much tighter.  I really like this in black and white!</td>', 'Wonderful capture.  I think the empty space is a bit too much though.  It is not enough to be effective negative space, but too much to be a "margin" of sorts, especially since the right is cropped much tighter.  I really like this in black and white!', '2003-03-31 00:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(248931, 15539, 7033, '<td valign="top">Tonal range complements this shot nicely.</td>', 'Tonal range complements this shot nicely.', '2003-03-31 00:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(248932, 15799, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors, adn an astounding execution of a wild idea.  I hope people look at this long enough to get teh full impact of it!</td>', 'Great colors, adn an astounding execution of a wild idea.  I hope people look at this long enough to get teh full impact of it!', '2003-03-31 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(248933, 15730, 7067, '<td valign="top">Not a bad subject for the time challenge.  But I would crop out a whole third of the picture at the very bottom and use B&amp;W instead of sepia toning.  Also contrast is a little dull.</td>', 'Not a bad subject for the time challenge.  But I would crop out a whole third of the picture at the very bottom and use B&W instead of sepia toning.  Also contrast is a little dull.', '2003-03-31 00:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(248934, 15360, 7607, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A two-fold subject. The house withstanding time and could also be the trees. Well composed,good color and textures .</td>', 'Very nice. A two-fold subject. The house withstanding time and could also be the trees. Well composed,good color and textures .', '2003-03-31 00:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
