(249997, 15768, 6804, '<td valign="top">This has been quite a week for me. This is a façade within the Paramount Ranch. Its part of Dr Quinn Medicine Woman series among others. It certainly helps to have a good subject to photograph. Thanks for all the comments and votes. This set up is for a MTV special  to air in a few weeks.</td>', 'This has been quite a week for me. This is a façade within the Paramount Ranch. Its part of Dr Quinn Medicine Woman series among others. It certainly helps to have a good subject to photograph. Thanks for all the comments and votes. This set up is for a MTV special  to air in a few weeks.', '2003-03-31 13:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
