(250787, 15401, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nick, I have this a 7.  I think shooting up the beach through the downed tree up to the standing one might have been effective (juxaposition type thing).  While the basic technical issues of focus and color were fine, it''s the "whoa" visual that just didn''t quite jump out at me.  I don''t think I even noticed the tree standing until this viewing.  A tighter crop of the "important" elements might have helped draw attention to those items.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nick, I have this a 7.  I think shooting up the beach through the downed tree up to the standing one might have been effective (juxaposition type thing).  While the basic technical issues of focus and color were fine, it''s the "whoa" visual that just didn''t quite jump out at me.  I don''t think I even noticed the tree standing until this viewing.  A tighter crop of the "important" elements might have helped draw attention to those items.  Rob the Swash', '2003-03-31 20:37:58.000000', NULL, 0),
