(251510, 15359, 4829, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by starblazer:</b></div><hr/><i>That cloud right over the angels head really detracts from this photo.  If you''re trying to go for a halo effect with that, it doesn''t really work for me.  The shape of the cloud doesn''t say ''halo''.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Wasn''t going for the halo, just happen to be taking a photo and then found out what the challenge was when I got home, the photo fit the time frame guidelines and I thought that I would submit it. Sorry it doesn''t work for ya.- Shelia</td>', 'Originally posted by starblazer:That cloud right over the angels head really detracts from this photo.  If you''re trying to go for a halo effect with that, it doesn''t really work for me.  The shape of the cloud doesn''t say ''halo''. Wasn''t going for the halo, just happen to be taking a photo and then found out what the challenge was when I got home, the photo fit the time frame guidelines and I thought that I would submit it. Sorry it doesn''t work for ya.- Shelia', '2003-04-01 11:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(251513, 15359, 4829, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherryk471:</b></div><hr/><i>Very nice however a different angle would have shown the dates better and I think this is the point of this photo.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know what you mean, but I hadn''t planned on submitting for this challenge. When I got home from New Orleans, saw the challenge, remembered the photo that I took and submitted it. The angle cropped out some of the vandalism that had been done to the statue as well...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-04-01 10:26:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by sherryk471:Very nice however a different angle would have shown the dates better and I think this is the point of this photo.  I know what you mean, but I hadn''t planned on submitting for this challenge. When I got home from New Orleans, saw the challenge, remembered the photo that I took and submitted it. The angle cropped out some of the vandalism that had been done to the statue as well...', '2003-04-01 11:24:29.000000', '2003-04-01 11:26:52.000000', 0),
